    bootstrap_publish_blocked_windows_native_symlink_privilege_2026-09-07, 2, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/bootstrap_publish_blocked_windows_native_symlink_privilege_2026-09-07.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."

